  "details": "PlayerAPI already has controls for SetWalkSpeed, SetJumpImpulse, etc, which can be used to make the movement joystick do nothing (so it's free to control something in Udon instead).   There should be a similar toggle to disable stick rotation as well, so both sticks can be used for Udon (and to prevent breaking the alignment in an \"Align Room With Spawn Point\" room).",
